You surround yourself with a radius [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] distortion of gravity, knocking back and dealing [47, 63, 75, 86, 95 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical damage to all creatures inside it.  The effect lasts [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns.  Deals 50% extra damage to pinned targets, in addition to the knockback.

The blast wave may hit targets more then once, depending on the radius and the knockback effect.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
